 on Social Media\nContact a Township Trustee\nFind an Event\nFind a Location\nFind a Service\nReport a Pothole or other Road Hazard\nSubmit a Request\nView County Ordinances\nView FAQs\nView a Slideshow\nVisit the Meeting Center\nFind a Document  Agendas\nForms & Applications\nJob Postings\nMinutes\nNews & Notices\nRelated Pages\nStart Content\nSearch\nSubmit\nHome\nProperty Taxes\nProperty Taxes\nVarious Vigo County offices coordinate the assessment and payment of property taxes. Taxes are due and payable in two (2) equal installments on or before May 10 and November 10.\nVisit the websites of these county offices for more information and news:\nCounty Assessor\nThe county assessor is responsible for maintaining records for townships without a township assessor, hearing real estate and personal property appeals and calculating inheritance tax.\nCounty Auditor\nAll county financial records are kept by the county auditor. The auditor calculates tax rates based on assessed value and budget needs and processes property tax refunds.\nCounty Treasurer\nAll property tax payments are made to the county treasurer.\nClick here Online Property Tax Payment information\nNews\nRelated Pages\nRecent News\nTax Rates 2013 pay 2014\nTax Rates for 2013 payable in 2014.\nTax Rates 2012 pay 2013 NOTICE TO TAXPAYERS OF VIGO COUNTY OF TAX RATES Notice is hereby given to the taxpayers of Vigo County, India...\n2010 Pay 2011 Tax Rates Tax rates for 2010 pay 2011 broken down by taxing unit and taxing district. First installment taxes are due M...\nTax Rates 2009 pay 2010 NOTICE TO TAXPAYERS OF VIGO COUNTY OF TAX RATES Notice is hereby given to the taxpayers of Vigo County, India...\nTax Rates 2008 pay 2009 NOTICE TO TAXPAYERS OF VIGO COUNTY OF TAX RATES New Goshen- Fire District Notice is hereby given to the taxpa...\nMore Recent News\nRelated Pages\nTax Sale Instructions\nContact Us\nVigo County Complex\n121 Oak St\nTerre Haute, IN 47807 Get Directions\nStaff Directory\nMore Information\n